mission "Lanterns Under Black Sails"
    name "Lanterns Under Black Sails"
    description "Sail to the Lantern Shoals, sink the two Company cutters, then return to Lantern Bay and report to the harbourmaster."
    source "Saint Brigid"
    destination "Lantern Bay"
    reward 520
    objective kills 2
    battlefield "The Lantern Shoals" 5514.0 2308.4
    enemy "The Lantern Shoals Guard 1"
    enemy "The Lantern Shoals Guard 2"
    speaker offer "Harbourmaster"
    speaker visit "Harbourmaster"
    speaker complete "Harbourmaster"
    to offer
        has "The Salt Tax: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `Two Company cutters have seized the pilot boats that guide ships through the Lantern Shoals.`
            `The pilots know the safe channels. Without them, the Company can strand independent traders on reefs and claim the cargo as salvage.`
            `The cutters are quick and likely carry a prize crew. The harbourmaster at Lantern Bay has sent a signal asking for help.`
            choice
                `(I will take this voyage. Tell me the course.)`
                    goto accept_job
                `(What makes this business so important?)`
                    goto more_details
                `(I have other waters to sail.)`
                    goto decline_job
            label more_details
                `The cutters are quick and likely carry a prize crew. The harbourmaster at Lantern Bay has sent a signal asking for help.`
                choice
                    `(Then I will see it done.)`
                        goto accept_job
                    `(Not this time.)`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `Sister Agnes blesses the voyage. “Do not mistake a small ship for a harmless one. Those cutters know every channel in these waters.”`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `The officer nods and rolls the chart closed. The offer will remain here if you change your mind.`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted Lanterns Under Black Sails. Sail to the Lantern Shoals, sink the two Company cutters, then return to Lantern Bay and report to the harbourmaster."
    on visit
        conversation
            `The cutters are gone, and the pilot boats limp back toward the bay. The harbourmaster says the Company has used the same trick in other regions.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `The pilots can guide larger ships through the reach again. Their charts reveal a second Company depot near Port Azure.`
        log "Completed Lanterns Under Black Sails. Received 520 gold. The pilots can guide larger ships through the reach again. Their charts reveal a second Company depot near Port Azure."
